@startuml
title Bank PP — Componentes y perfiles
left to right direction
package "Cliente Java 25" {
  [UI Swing] --> [Controladores]
  [Controladores] --> [Servicios de aplicación]
  [Servicios de aplicación] --> [Dominio POO]
  [Servicios de aplicación] --> (Puertos Repository)
  (Puertos Repository) --> [Selector de perfil]
  [Selector de perfil] --> [Adaptador JDBC local] : perfil local
  [Selector de perfil] --> [Adaptador HTTP Supabase] : perfil remoto
}
database "PostgreSQL local" as LocalDB
cloud "Supabase Auth + Data API" as Supabase
database "PostgreSQL Supabase" as CloudDB
[Adaptador JDBC local] --> LocalDB : JDBC
[Adaptador HTTP Supabase] --> Supabase : HTTPS + clave pública + JWT
Supabase --> CloudDB : RLS + RPC
note bottom of CloudDB
No distribuir service_role ni contraseña DB.
end note
@enduml